{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは〜藤嶌果歩(19)です🐑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "5月が終わった！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "色んなことがあった5月でした〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いや、4月も色んなことあったし3月も色んなことはあったんですけども"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんにとってはどんな5月でしたか！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "5月はゴールデンウィークもありましたもんね！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ゴールデンウィークは実は私北海道に行きまして、まあこの話についてはまた今度話しますね中々濃かったので🐮"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202605/mobyW0llB.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "5月最後の日は久しぶりのミーグリでした"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ニコニコだね"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202605/mobZUfHiS.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "珍しくジャケットを着て大人ぶってみました😤🤍どう？？大人っぽいですか？"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202605/mob5xbLOA.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🎶"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんと久しぶりにお話できてとても幸せ指数が高まりました！⤴︎︎︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさんのおめでとうをありがとうね〜"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202605/mobVONcMy.png", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202605/mobwQsjI6.png", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もう暑いからサンダルデビューしてるよ☁️"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あとはエアコンデビューもしたよ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それでは今日はこの辺で！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "日曜日もお疲れ様です🐑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6月もがんばろー！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "藤嶌果歩"}], "source": "official"}